                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2913: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Crane</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-08-05T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 5,
                                1920—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>200. Your No. 212, August 4, noon.</p>
                <p>Unless representatives of Powers concerned are agreed on simultaneous
                    communication to the Chinese Government you should withhold representations
                    until further instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
